title: safeDocumentsExamine
position: -1165,1070
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You rummage through the documents. Nothing particularly interesting. Just financial records and the like.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][When you flip through one of the stapled packets, a folded-up piece of paper that had been loosely stuck between its pages falls to the floor. You pick it up to examine it.][/nomarkup]
Love Letter: For my beloved Diana, the only one who can see me for who I am and pierce the darkness I've armored myself with... The only person who knows my pain intimately enough to stave my Beast away... #line:0999c1e 
Love Letter: I can't stand to see you used by that insect of a Kindred you call your Master any longer. Like a mosquito, or some hungry parasite, she doesn't just sting, she bites and drains and takes and bleeds you dry until there is nothing left of you nor the woman you used to be - the woman I love... #line:0333eda 
Love Letter: You have spent so long under her cruel watch - nothing more than a convenient tool to be used and abused, and I think it has been long enough... So fight it.
Love Letter: Fight the bond she has forced on you, the chains that bind you to her - choose me, and in doing so, the freedom you deserve. But above all else, choose yourself, Dove. #line:0a132e0 
Love Letter: I want us to live together - be together as equals, such that we'll be bonded only through trust and love rather than coercion and obligation.
Love Letter: I promise that once the last of your bindings are broken, we will escape and make our home far, far away from here - from Jyhad and the pressures foisted upon us by wicked institutions.  #line:06ece37 
Love Letter: It will be just you - and me. Together in the night. #line:07e7453 
Love Letter: With love,  #line:026c4fd 
Love Letter: Lucia #line:00d2b26 #lastline
<<set $luciaLoveLetter to true>>
<<jump shotsFired>>
===
